-- נספחים ב'3 ו־ג'3 — תוספת אופק 2022 למורים בעלי תואר BA (קוד דירוג 101): the Ofek 2022 supplement of a first-degree (BA) teacher on the conversion table
-- (rating code 101), by grade — from 1.9.2022 (annex ב'3) and, twice as much,
-- from 1.9.2023 (annex ג'3) — as the conditions-of-service portal publishes
-- them: a page of the wage agreement of 19.10.2022 as signed, with its
-- hand-written page number and the parties' note that the annexes are
-- agreed. They are annexes ב3 and ג3 of that agreement, whose §5 pays the
-- supplement by them, and which the agreement's signed copy prints after
-- its signatures (encoded, imported).
--
-- Checked here: each is the signed copy's annex grade for grade, and
-- prints the day the signed copy's prints.
--
-- Annex ג'3 prints "מעודכן החל מיום 1.1.2023", as the signed copy's annex ג3
-- does, where §5.2 applies the supplement of 1.9.2023 and every other ג annex
-- prints that day: F-ofek-hadash-wage-2022-signed-a, read as a misprint, and
-- the follow-up committee's decision of 14.1.2025 (§5) says the annex applies
-- from 1.9.2023. The page here is the signed agreement's own, not a
-- publication of the ministry's own reading, so it is that finding and not
-- a new one. A rule pays it from 1.9.2023.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `base-agreement-46`
IMPORT `tables-common`
IMPORT `2025-01-14_ofek-hadash_vaadat-maakev_taut-sofer-correction_agorot-salary-tables`

§ `נספחים ב'3 ו־ג'3 — תוספת אופק 2022 למורים בעלי תואר BA (קוד דירוג 101)`

-- akn:hc_1/p1 The annex's label, "נספח ב'3"; the table below it is annex ב'3.
-- akn:hc_1/p2 The page number written in by hand (6); no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p5 The annex's label, "נספח ג'3"; the table below it is annex ג'3.
-- akn:hc_1/p8 "נספחים א1-א9, ב1-ב7 מוסכמים": the parties' note that the annexes are agreed; no rule of its own.

-- Annex ב'3, as it prints under it: "מעודכן החל מיום 1.9.2022".
@ref akn:hc_1/p3 akn:hc_1/t1 akn:hc_1/p4
`annex ב'3 of the Ofek 2022 supplement` MEANS
    `a published supplement` "תוספת אופק 2022 למורים בעלי תואר BA (קוד דירוג 101)" (JUST 101) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022)
        (LIST `cell` 1 792.77, `cell` 1.5 730.27, `cell` 2 667.77, `cell` 2.5 605.27, `cell` 3 542.77, `cell` 3.5 480.27, `cell` 4 417.77, `cell` 4.5 355.27, `cell` 5 292.77, `cell` 5.5 230.27, `cell` 6 167.77, `cell` 6.5 130.27, `cell` 7 92.77, `cell` 7.5 55.27, `cell` 8 17.77, `cell` 8.5 8.89, `cell` 9 0.00)

-- Annex ג'3, as it prints under it: "מעודכן החל מיום 1.1.2023".
@ref akn:hc_1/p6 akn:hc_1/t2 akn:hc_1/p7
`annex ג'3 of the Ofek 2022 supplement` MEANS
    `a published supplement` "תוספת אופק 2022 למורים בעלי תואר BA (קוד דירוג 101)" (JUST 101) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2023)
        (LIST `cell` 1 1585.54, `cell` 1.5 1460.54, `cell` 2 1335.54, `cell` 2.5 1210.54, `cell` 3 1085.54, `cell` 3.5 960.54, `cell` 4 835.54, `cell` 4.5 710.54, `cell` 5 585.54, `cell` 5.5 460.54, `cell` 6 335.54, `cell` 6.5 260.54, `cell` 7 185.54, `cell` 7.5 110.54, `cell` 8 35.54, `cell` 8.5 17.77, `cell` 9 0.00)

§§ `בדיקת הטבלאות`

-- (1) The days each prints, as the signed copy's annexes print them.
#ASSERT `annex ב'3 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`'s `published supplement from` EQUALS `the day the annex prints` `annex ב3 of the signed copy`
#ASSERT `annex ג'3 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`'s `published supplement from` EQUALS `the day the annex prints` `annex ג3 of the signed copy`

-- Annex ג'3's printed day is not the day it applies from: §5.2 and the
-- decision of 14.1.2025 (§5) say 1.9.2023.
#ASSERT NOT (`annex ג'3 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`'s `published supplement from` EQUALS `the day annex ג3 applies from, as the decision of 14.1.2025 says`)
#ASSERT `the day annex ג3 applies from, as the decision of 14.1.2025 says` EQUALS `the day §§4–5 apply the annex from` `annex ג3 of the signed copy`

-- (2) The signed copy's annexes ב3 and ג3, grade for grade, seventeen grades
-- each (1 to 9 by halves).
GIVEN a IS A `signed-copy annex`
GIVETH A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the signed copy's supplement for rating 101 in` a IS
    GIVEN g YIELD `the signed-copy cell` (`the first table of` a) 0 g

#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for rating 101 in` `annex ב3 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ב'3 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`))
#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for rating 101 in` `annex ג3 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ג'3 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`))
#ASSERT count (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for rating 101 in` `annex ב3 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ב'3 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`) EQUALS 17
#ASSERT count (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for rating 101 in` `annex ג3 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ג'3 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`) EQUALS 17
#ASSERT `the annex as the decision of 14.1.2025 has it` `annex ב3 of the signed copy` EQUALS `annex ב3 of the signed copy`

-- (3) The decision of 14.1.2025 (§3) puts annexes ב1 and ג1, printed to the
-- agora, in place of the agreement's annexes printed to the shekel; at every
-- whole grade they are these annexes' amounts.
#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for rating 101 in` `annex ב1 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `in` `annex ב'3 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`))
#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for rating 101 in` `annex ג1 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `in` `annex ג'3 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`))
#ASSERT count (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for rating 101 in` `annex ב1 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) `in` `annex ב'3 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`) EQUALS 9

-- The supplements at work: §5's supplement for a full position at grade
-- 1.5 on 1.9.2022, as the signed copy pays it, beside annex ב'3.
#ASSERT `the published supplement on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) `annex ב'3 of the Ofek 2022 supplement` 1.5 EQUALS `the Ofek 2022 supplement under the signed copy's annexes` 3 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) 1.5 1
